      "name": "a moved note's own links",
      "input": {
        "text": "![img](assets/a.png) [sib](Sibling.md#h) [up](../Top.md)\n[web](https://example.com) [abs](C:/x.md) [root](/x.md) [self](#s) [me](Plan.md#s)\n[ref]: ./assets/b.png",
